1
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:37,060
W-W-We...

2
00:00:37,260 --> 00:00:40,160
Do you think I am a fool?

3
00:00:43,400 --> 00:00:46,030
The Chief played a beautiful trick.

4
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:49,960
He indeed treats this girl differently.

5
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:53,730
Ye Qifeng.

6
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:56,090
Take these two to the dungeon.

7
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:58,860
The charge is framing others

8
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:00,860
and slandering the distinguished guest
of Yan Sect.

9
00:01:00,860 --> 00:01:01,930
Mercy, Chief!

10
00:01:02,700 --> 00:01:03,600
My Lord.

11
00:01:07,760 --> 00:01:08,630
Mister.

12
00:01:09,230 --> 00:01:13,030
How did you know the Poison-Repelling
Pearl would cause frostbite?

13
00:01:14,460 --> 00:01:15,460
I didn't.

14
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:17,300
I just made it up.

15
00:01:20,430 --> 00:01:21,430
They were guilty,

16
00:01:21,530 --> 00:01:23,789
so naturally they gave themselves away.

17
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:27,500
This mister is quite smart sometimes.

18
00:01:28,400 --> 00:01:31,130
Did he come over specifically
to help me just now?

19
00:01:36,860 --> 00:01:39,330
Girl, this pearl is for you.

20
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:43,960
F-For me?

21
00:01:44,560 --> 00:01:47,160
But isn't this
your most precious possession?

22
00:01:47,800 --> 00:01:49,530
What's precious is not the pearl,

23
00:01:49,530 --> 00:01:51,259
but the one who can use it well.

24
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,729
There is a powerful force
hidden within you.

25
00:01:55,030 --> 00:01:57,630
Perhaps there will be a day
when you need it.

26
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,660
Remember what happened today.

27
00:01:59,660 --> 00:02:01,390
You can't read people's minds.

28
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:03,600
But as long as you have
a clear conscience,

29
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,260
there's nothing to fear.

30
00:02:12,430 --> 00:02:13,800
Thank you, Grandpa.

31
00:02:15,800 --> 00:02:18,400
Madam, Senior Medical Maniac
wants to see you.

32
00:02:19,329 --> 00:02:20,630
I'll go right away.

33
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:26,100
I told you,

34
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:27,800
don't call me Madam.

35
00:02:29,130 --> 00:02:29,860
Yes,

36
00:02:29,930 --> 00:02:30,560
Madam.

37
00:02:46,030 --> 00:02:48,160
Lost again.

38
00:02:52,500 --> 00:02:53,860
There should be someone over there.

39
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:55,390
I'll go ask for directions.

40
00:02:57,130 --> 00:02:58,100
From today on,

41
00:02:58,100 --> 00:02:59,460
we are roommates.

42
00:02:59,460 --> 00:03:00,000
No,

43
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,800
I object.

44
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:12,800
This is the Chief's arrangement.

45
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,060
Objection overruled.

46
00:03:14,300 --> 00:03:15,360
What a sin.

47
00:03:16,460 --> 00:03:17,200
By the way,

48
00:03:17,600 --> 00:03:18,600
I'm a vegetarian.

49
00:03:18,760 --> 00:03:20,000
So from today on,

50
00:03:20,360 --> 00:03:22,090
you have to be a vegetarian too.

51
00:03:27,030 --> 00:03:27,860
Forget it.

52
00:03:28,560 --> 00:03:29,430
Just wait.

53
00:03:29,600 --> 00:03:31,329
I'll go tidy up the room for you.

54
00:03:35,260 --> 00:03:36,790
Commander Ye is so pitiful.

55
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,260
Who is it?

56
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:48,560
Uh...

57
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:50,500
I got lost,

58
00:03:50,500 --> 00:03:51,900
so I came to ask for directions.

59
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:52,460
My name is...

60
00:03:52,460 --> 00:03:54,800
I've never seen you in the sect before.

61
00:03:55,430 --> 00:03:57,260
Who exactly are you?

62
00:03:59,130 --> 00:04:00,430
Not going to talk, huh?

63
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:09,060
Hey, hey, hey, wait a minute!

64
00:04:09,060 --> 00:04:09,430
I...

65
00:04:09,630 --> 00:04:10,030
T-This

66
00:04:12,930 --> 00:04:13,900
height...

67
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:14,700
At this speed,

68
00:04:14,700 --> 00:04:16,100
I'll fall to my death!

69
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:22,600
Qiongqi.

70
00:04:23,030 --> 00:04:24,060
The room is ready.

71
00:04:24,200 --> 00:04:24,600
You...

72
00:04:30,660 --> 00:04:31,530
Madam!

73
00:04:32,730 --> 00:04:33,600
Senior Physician,

74
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:34,800
please save Madam!

75
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,000
What happened?

76
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:37,200
Put her down quickly.

77
00:04:41,159 --> 00:04:43,330
Who hurt her so badly?

78
00:04:45,060 --> 00:04:46,100
It was Qiongqi.

79
00:04:48,400 --> 00:04:49,500
He's back.

80
00:04:50,730 --> 00:04:51,730
As you know,

81
00:04:51,960 --> 00:04:54,500
although he tries to suppress
his evil nature by converting to Buddhism,

82
00:04:54,500 --> 00:04:56,130
his true form is a fierce beast after all,

83
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:57,860
so he still loses control
and goes on rampages.

84
00:04:57,860 --> 00:05:00,460
This time, Madam just
happened to run into him.

85
00:05:07,700 --> 00:05:09,660
Despite multiple fractures
and internal injuries,

86
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:11,660
her breathing is unusually steady,

87
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:13,660
and her wounds are even healing rapidly.

88
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:15,920
What exactly is inside this girl's body?

89
00:05:15,960 --> 00:05:18,020
How is she? Madam will be fine, right?

90
00:05:18,230 --> 00:05:19,330
It is nothing serious.

91
00:05:19,330 --> 00:05:21,930
She will fully recover
after a few days of rest.

92
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:24,230
It really is...

93
00:05:24,400 --> 00:05:25,560
the Power of Nuwa.

94
00:05:27,260 --> 00:05:28,990
If it truly is the Power of Nuwa,

95
00:05:29,400 --> 00:05:31,060
once the world finds out,

96
00:05:31,260 --> 00:05:33,260
this girl will never know peace again.
